msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/processes/content/formalized-publication-authoring.bpmn:78
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Decompose topic areas, check the folio's blocks, compute, and ingested library, shortlist needed external papers and reference datasets (CODATA, PDG, AME), query accessible scholarly and mathematical databases (Crossref/DOI, arXiv, PubMed, InspireHEP, OpenAlex, Semantic Scholar, Google Scholar, plus OEIS across unit-rescaled / logged / unlogged / factorial-cleared forms, KnotInfo / LinkInfo / SnapPy / Regina censuses, LMFDB, and >= 80 dps PSLQ constant recognition whenever integer sequences, series coefficients, constants, or knot/number-theoretic invariants appear), ingest retrieved references, texts, and datasets into the Knowledge Graph, and assess relevancy and claim boundaries before drafting. A result settled in a held paper is cited, not re-derived."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/processes/content/formalized-publication-authoring.bpmn:176
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Demote the block to a conjecture, or state the open step with `sorry` and a citation, and write-ahead checkpoint the parent epic (`checkpoint:` / `handover:` / `reentry:` notes on `cat/cat-harness/beans`, active vs excluded proof/compute routes, and the Worktree / `/tmp`-Overlay / `.lake`-Donor Lease Table — never mutating a claimed child executor bean's `.md` file). Whenever an authoring session stalls or returns on a subsequent turn after another session advanced the repository, reconcile non-destructively via `stalled-agent-triage` before resuming. Never weaken the statement until it passes."
msgstr ""

