msgid "Write the narrative statement and narrative proof in the block's `.md` and the formal statement and proof in its `.lean`. Write the Lean statement first and ask whether it could be false. Record source retrieval and verification provenance (database/API, DOI/arXiv/PMID, date, exact theorem/equation/dataset locator, and relevancy boundary) in authoring notes and attestations, and link formal citations (`\\cite{...}` / `cites`) and Liquid dataset or witness values (`{{ ... }}`). An unproved step is `sorry` with a citation; a dependence on a conjecture is an explicit class hypothesis."
